  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">you as my horizon line</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œIs there anything I can do to help?â€ Bow asks. Glimmer looks up at him. She appreciates him asking, butâ€¦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€œDo you wanna come home with me and stand in between me and my mom every time weâ€™re in a room together?â€ she says. Bow gives her a &lt;i&gt;look&lt;/i&gt; as he sits down beside her on the couch. â€œSorry,â€ Glimmer says, sighing. â€œNo, there isnâ€™t really anything you can do.â€&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€œI would go home with you if I could,â€ Bow says. Glimmer half-laughs, pauses, and reassesses the situation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€œIs thereâ€¦a reason that you &lt;i&gt;canâ€™t&lt;/i&gt;?â€&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Glimmer has been avoiding seeing her parents for three years. When she finally has to go home, she takes Bow with her. They pretend to be dating, because clearly that's the best possible way to justify his presence and this decision will have no unforeseen consequences at all.)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
