          <rdf:li>and they were ROOMMATES</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>who pretended to date</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mutual Pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>glimmer is oblivious to both bow's and her own feelings</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Family Drama</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>(a lot of it)</rdf:li>
